<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39926" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπικῡδ-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
		only in 
			Comp.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστερος</span> (unless the Posit. is to be
		restored in <i><span class="en">
			Sapph.
			<u>Supp.</u>
			8.11
		</span></i>), <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>glorious,
				distinguished</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>HG</u>
				5.1.36
			</span></i>; <i>brilliant, successful</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστερα τὰ</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πράγματα ἐποίησεν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					4.139
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστεραι ἐλπίδες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					16.4.3
				</span></i>
			; and of persons, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστερος ταῖς
				ἐλπίσι</span>
			<i>more sanguine</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				5.69.11
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.252
			</span></i>, al., <i><span class="en">
				Onos.
				23.2
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				Comp.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-εστέρως, ἀγωνίζεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					5.23.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
